		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Chartreuse, fey fungus. Infests sentient beings and forces them to obey fungal commands.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 11, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 spore pod +2 (<strong>W</strong><strong>I</strong><strong>S</strong> damage), <strong>MV</strong> close, <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Avoidance</strong>. If struck while infesting a creature, CON 12+ to avoid attack, which instead mold's host.</p><p></p><p><strong>Infest</strong>. Cover the head of host creature, dominating it until mold is removed. WIS Damage. 1d8 WIS damage, docile and compliant at 0 WIS.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
